#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgid "Add a query"
msgstr "Afegeix una consulta"

msgid ""
"An error occurred while accessing your Wordpress website. Please, verify the "
"domain name %s"
msgstr ""
"S'ha produït un error en accedir al vostre lloc Wordpress. Si us plau, "
"verifiqueu el domini %s"

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgid "Ascending"
msgstr "Ascendent"

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgid "Author"
msgstr "Autor"

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgid "Cache lifetime (excluding pull to refresh)"
msgstr "Durada de la memòria cau (excepte arrossegar per actualitzar)"

msgid "Categories successfully saved"
msgstr "Categories desades correctament"

msgid "Click here to download our Wordpress plugin"
msgstr "Feu clic aquí per descarregar el nostre plugin de Wordpress"

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgid "Cover & Thumbnails are only visible when queries are not grouped."
msgstr "La coberta i les miniatures només són visibles quan les consultes no estan agrupades."

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgid "Date"
msgstr "Data"

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgid "Descending"
msgstr "Descendent"

msgid "Enter your Wordpress URL:"
msgstr "Introduïu l'URL del vostre Wordpress:"

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgid "Group all queries into a single list"
msgstr "Agrupa totes les consultes en una sola llista"

msgid "ID"
msgstr "ID"

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgid ""
"If your WordPress is secured by a login/password, and/or you want to display "
"private posts you can set here a user to be used to retrieve posts."
msgstr "Si el WordPress està protegit amb usuari/contrasenya, o voleu mostrar publicacions privades, podeu definir aquí un usuari per recuperar les publicacions."

msgid "Loading categories"
msgstr "Carregant categories"

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgid "Manage WordPress"
msgstr "Gestiona WordPress"

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgid "Manage queries"
msgstr "Gestiona les consultes"

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgid "No cache"
msgstr "Sense memòria cau"

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgid ""
"Note: cache is automatically refreshed on any user pull to refresh action "
"whatever the lifetime set."
msgstr "Nota: la memòria cau s'actualitza automàticament en qualsevol acció d'arrossegar per actualitzar de l'usuari, sigui quina sigui la durada definida."

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgid "Pages"
msgstr "Pàgines"

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgid "Relevance"
msgstr "Rellevància"

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgid "Show title & subtitle"
msgstr "Mostra el títol i el subtítol"

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgid "Sorry, we are unable to fetch any category or post from your WordPress."
msgstr "Ho sentim, no hem pogut obtenir cap categoria ni publicació del WordPress."

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgid "Sort by"
msgstr "Ordena per"

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgid "Sort order"
msgstr "Ordre"

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgid "Strip shortcodes"
msgstr "Elimina els shortcodes"

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgid "Unable to find your WordPress or /wp-json/ endpoint."
msgstr "No es pot trobar el WordPress ni el punt final /wp-json/."

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgid "Unlimited (until any pull to refresh)"
msgstr "Il·limitada (fins a qualsevol arrossegament per actualitzar)"

msgid ""
"We are sorry but no category has been detected on your Wordpress website."
msgstr "Ho sentim, però no s'ha detectat cap categoria al vostre lloc Wordpress."

msgid ""
"We are sorry but our Wordpress plugin hasn't been detected on your website. "
"Please be sure it is correctly installed and activated."
msgstr "Ho sentim, però no s'ha detectat el nostre plugin de Wordpress al vostre lloc web. Assegureu-vos que està correctament instal·lat i activat."

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgid "WordPress URL"
msgstr "URL de WordPress"

msgid "Wordpress"
msgstr "Wordpress"

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgid "You can mix posts & pages in the queries if needed."
msgstr "Podeu barrejar publicacions i pàgines a les consultes si cal."

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgid ""
"You can mix posts & pages in the queries if needed, however it's not "
"recommended and can lead to random sorting."
msgstr "Podeu barrejar publicacions i pàgines a les consultes si cal; tanmateix, no es recomana i pot provocar un ordre aleatori."

